      <title>气候变暖叠加厄尔尼诺 8月再创全球有记录以来最热月份纪录</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/climate/post/20260912/%E6%B0%94%E5%80%99%E5%8F%98%E6%9A%96%E5%8F%A0%E5%8A%A0%E5%8E%84%E5%B0%94%E5%B0%BC%E8%AF%BA-8%E6%9C%88%E5%86%8D%E5%88%9B%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E6%9C%89%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%9C%80%E7%83%AD%E6%9C%88%E4%BB%BD%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95/</link>
